---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { brandFor } from '@/config/brand';

const brand = brandFor('en');
---

<LegalLayout title="Cookie policy" updated="July 2026" path="/cookies">
  <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
  <p>
    A cookie is a small file stored on your device when you visit a website. This site makes
    minimal use of storage and does not use tracking or advertising cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What we use on this site</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Necessary technical storage:</strong> we remember locally that you have accepted this
      notice (<code>localStorage</code>), so we do not show it to you again.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Third-party fonts:</strong> we load typefaces from Google Fonts, which involves a
      connection to Google servers. We do not install analytics or advertising cookies.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. How to manage them</h2>
  <p>
    You can clear local storage and block cookies from your browser settings. The site will
    continue to work normally.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For any questions about this policy, write to us at
    <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}>{brand.email}</a>.
  </p>

</LegalLayout>
